# Hybrid RAG Architecture - Implemented

## System Overview

The Voice Ledger now implements a **hybrid RAG router** that intelligently combines:
- **ChromaDB Cloud:** Documentation, standards, research (2,863 chunks)
- **PostgreSQL:** Live operational data (batches, farmers, transactions)

This provides context-aware responses grounded in both **knowledge** and **real-time data**.

---

